  "notes": [
    "Compound of *tener* — follows the same irregular patterns throughout",
    "Irregular yo present: *mantengo* (go-verb)",
    "e→ie stem change in present: tú/él/ellos forms (mantienes, mantiene, mantienen); nosotros keeps *mantene-*",
    "Irregular preterite stem: *mantuv-* (mantuve, mantuviste, mantuvo, mantuvimos, mantuvieron)",
    "Irregular future/conditional stem: *mantendr-* (mantendré, mantendría)",
    "Subjuntivo from yo stem: *manteng-* (mantenga, mantengas…)",
    "Past participle: *mantenido*",
    "*mantener + noun* = to maintain/keep (*mantener la calma* — to keep calm; *mantener el peso* — to maintain weight)",
    "*mantenerse* (reflexive) = to keep oneself, to stay (*mantenerse en forma* — to keep fit)"
  ],
